    "description": "When Disney Imagineers Leota Toombs, Maggie Irvine Elliott and Harriet Burns were working on the Tropical Serenade attraction (now known as Walt Disney’s Enchanted Tiki Room), experimenting with which garment led them to discover the right material for the tiki birds' fur cloth?",
